OL,3,GNEWSA'Good for the people' if
OL,4,Apoliticians stopped doing media, says
OL,5,Asecretary of state
OL,6,
OL,7,FMinisters on the Stormont executive say
OL,8,Fthey can't strike a budget without
OL,9,Fadditional money from the Treasury.
